"YEL顾老爷：少侠也一起来吧，我这纸鸢的手艺，可是不传之秘，哈哈哈。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={4,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}},{type="showbutton",args={5,1}},{type="gaintab",args={"315004",5}}},caozuoName5="制作纸鸢",buttonShow5=0,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={{type="doc",args={"CYN顾老爷虽已至暮年，但双手却极为灵巧，简简单单的竹条与丝绢，上下翻飞间，一个精致无比的纸鸢就成了。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN你不由得惊叹，依着顾老爷的手法，也做出了一个纸鸢。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={3,0}},{type="showbutton",args={5,0}},{type="showbutton",args={6,1}},{type="addobject",args={"rwwp11"}},{type="outobject",args={"rwwp10"}},{type="gaintab",args={"315004",6}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName6="交谈",buttonShow6=0,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={{type="doc",args={"YEL顾老爷：清明正是好时节，本就该轻轻松松地度过。少侠既然已经做成了纸鸢，何不玩耍一番呢？也好叫纸鸢将心中的烦恼一并带走。NOR"}}},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"315004",4}}}},autoResult1={{type="showbutton",args={4,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},rwnpc04={id="rwnpc04",baseId="rwnpc10",combatid={1,1001},name="顾小宝",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="查看",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN他有些怕生，躲在顾老爷的身后。NOR"}}},caozuoName2="查看",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"CYN他手里拿着新做的纸鸢，看起来很是开心。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions